claim.claim-text:
receiving, from a base station, a radio resource control, RRC, message including a measurement gap sharing configuration, wherein the measurement gap sharing configuration includes measurement gap sharing scheme information;
identifying a first measurement gap sharing ratio allocated to a first measurement object and a second measurement gap sharing ratio allocated to a second measurement object based on a type of dual connectivity, DC, configured for the UE and a value indicated by the measurement gap sharing scheme information; and
determining a first scaling factor for the first measurement object based on the first measurement gap sharing ratio and a second scaling factor for the second measurement object based on the second measurement gap sharing ratio.
